{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zTI98LwmV21795772913.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市顯著造好，成交突破2萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>國務院常務會議在一個月內，兩度提及穩定資本市場改革，市場憧憬「國家隊」加力穩定市場。</p><p></p><p>四大指數升幅約百分之3至11。上證綜合指數重回3,600點水平。深證成分指數和深圳創業板指數，均見逾兩年來最大單日升幅。滬深京三市成交增加，至逾2萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>半導體和算力硬件板塊上升，銀行股則逆市下跌。</p><p></p><p>總計全星期，四大指數終止兩連跌，累積上升約百分之2至10，當中，深圳創業板指數升幅最大。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:44:00.642213+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T01:37:14.202474+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:23.913240+00:00","content_hash":"21c7b12290e7475920171b3f6c348d72987aad8bc8269ad65e61f40dad2fe137","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:44:00.642213+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}